{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10211032","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10211032","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1021103201:3":{"text":"꾸륵꾸륵!","source_cn":"咕嘎咕嘎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38E54CA1B0D3853D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1021103202:0":{"text":"아니, 이건 오해야. 우리 말 좀 들어줘!","source_cn":"不，这是误会，请听我们说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C9AE86F4EE1BEAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1021103203:0":{"text":"우리는 침입자가 아니라 유적을 찾으러 왔어!","source_cn":"我们并不是入侵者，只是在寻找遗迹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68E469751A467844","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1021103204:0":{"text":"꾸, 꾸륵...? “유적”이라는 단어를 어떻게 말해야 하는지 기억이 안 나.","source_cn":"咕、咕呜……？我想不起来“遗迹”这个词该怎么翻译了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A9FB13372EE33AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1021103205:0":{"text":"구... 꾸륵...","source_cn":"咕……咕咕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BC7152289FB6313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1021103206:0":{"text":"후, 드디어 진정한 것 같네.","source_cn":"呼，他好像冷静下来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD4FD20BC7E9A478","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1021103207:0":{"text":"끽, 끼익... 꾸륵?","source_cn":"嘎，嘎咕咕，咕咕？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF185DFD90C6CF916","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1021103208:0":{"text":"“비석... 너희... 찾아”? 맞아! 우리는 절대 악의가 있는 게 아니야!","source_cn":"“石碑——你们——在找”，没错没错！我们没有恶意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BF5DB980D1AFF2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:咕布林首领":{"text":"고블린 우두머리","source":"咕布林首领","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:梅丽莎":{"text":"멜리사","source":"梅丽莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}